==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Cosmic Eclipse|Heracross|9}} from the {{TCG|Cosmic Eclipse}} expansion.
*'''Single-Horn Throw''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Chilling Reign|Heracross|6}} from the {{TCG|Chilling Reign}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

